military use and specially designed to discharge an inert
projectile by compressed air or CO 2.
c. 	Weapons using caseless ammunition;
d. 	Accessories designed for firearms specified in ML1.a., ML1.b. or ML1.c., as
follows:
1. 	Detachable Cartridge magazines;
2. 	Sound suppressors or moderators;
3. 	'Gun-mountings';
Technical Note:
For the purposes of ML1.d.3., a 'gun-mounting' is a fixture designed to
mount a gun onto a ground "vehicle", "aircraft", "vessel" or structure.
4. 	Flash suppressors;
5. 	Optical weapon-sights with electronic image processing;
6. 	Optical weapon-sights specially designed for military use.
